            "text": "<p>Welcome to the Golf & Leisure Club - where all are welcome. A capsule inspired by some of our best times whether at the country club, playing backyard games with friends or on your next golf vacation. A head to toe look, the capsule features the highly anticipated FS-Slide, Vacay Button Ups, a new Swim Short and plenty of accessories to complete the vibes. Secure your gear and book that next vacation or simply #EnjoytheWalk wherever your leisure finds you.<\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "Shop All",
            "button_link_1": "https:\/\/truelinkswear.com\/collections\/golf-and-leisure-club",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
